  storyId: flustered-baker-borrowed-dish
  firstVisitStory: 'I borrowed her casserole dish forty years ago.


    I meant
    to return it washed. Then I thought I should put something in it. Things got
    away from me.


    She needs it tomorrow. Express, please.


    The recipe
    book and oven mitt are an apology. Forty years probably deserves two.'
